committer NeverSightAI <neversightai@gmail.com> 1794967017 +0800

Use compact canonical alias lookup in mixed Clang builds

Route AArch64 and non-DIET MIPS alias IDs through their generated tries.
Share delimiter handling, the existing 15-byte limit and no-alias result
with the original parser. Keep the private Clang parser compact and its
ELF code and tables separate from the original hot functions.

Restrict the implementation to configurations with an active caller;
preserve GCC and existing dedicated-trie behavior. Validate complete
records, architecture-only and DIET builds, Make/Xcode/MSVC, and real
PE/ELF output in Capstone and NeverD with source-built LLVM.
